 "fill_reason": {
  "pin_bound": "1,245-pin engine face (W, abutting the shell E face) needs >= ~420 um at <= 3 pins/um, and 32 bank SRAMs (51.4x20.8) need >= 20 um channels / >= 20 um edge gaps; std cells only 11.2k um2, so the outline is set by the pin face + macro channel lattice, not by area; sp7d: column-channel bound (>= 56 um W-side pin-escape channel per SRAM column, sp6 GRT overflow in 24-um channels); W face kept at 518.4"
 },
